From: LyricMay LEDE maintainers <lede@lyricmay.local>
Date: Mon, 25 Aug 2026 21:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: yt921x: force RGMII CPU-port link

The BDY G98 connects each YT9215 CPU port directly to an RK3588 GMAC
through a fixed RGMII link. Set the switch XMII force-link bit while
configuring RGMII so the switch-side MAC-to-MAC link is brought up
consistently.

---
 drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.c b/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.c
index 98520fc..9999999 100644
--- a/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.c
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.c
@@ -4440,7 +4440,8 @@ static int yt921x_port_config(struct yt921x_priv *priv, int port,
		if (res)
			return res;
 
-		ctrl = YT921X_XMII_MODE_RGMII | YT921X_XMII_EN;
+		ctrl = YT921X_XMII_MODE_RGMII | YT921X_XMII_EN |
+		       YT921X_XMII_LINK;
		if (interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_RGMII_ID ||
		    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_RGMII_TXID)
			ctrl |= YT921X_XMII_RGMII_TX_DELAY_2NS;
@@ -4449,7 +4450,7 @@ static int yt921x_port_config(struct yt921x_priv *priv, int port,
			/* 13 * 150ps = 1.95ns, closest to the standard 2ns */
			ctrl |= YT921X_XMII_RGMII_RX_DELAY_150PS(13);
 
-		mask = YT921X_XMII_MODE_M | YT921X_XMII_EN |
+		mask = YT921X_XMII_MODE_M | YT921X_XMII_EN | YT921X_XMII_LINK |
		       YT921X_XMII_RGMII_TX_DELAY_2NS |
		       YT921X_XMII_RGMII_TX_DELAY_150PS_M |
		       YT921X_XMII_RGMII_RX_DELAY_150PS_M;
-- 
2.43.0
